SUMMARY:Woodshop Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nHave a project you need he
 lp with? Want to learn how to safely use the wood shop equipment? Just wan
 t to hang out and talk shop? Come on by. Each week one or more of our more
  knowledgeable wood workers will be there to help. No need to sign up.\n\n
 We look forward to seeing you all there!\n\nThis is a members only event.
